# View menu and Display Settings: atom styles (bonds drawn only in the
# bonded styles or with Show > Bonds), colour modes (element, grain
# boundaries, crystal orientation from the IPF sidecar), labels, the legend,
# projection, display settings (looks, atom size, colour schemes) and undo
# keeping the colours of the mode.
open docs/manual/examples/sio2_pack.xyz
expect-bonds 0
view style ball-and-stick
expect-bonds 52
view style balls
expect-bonds 0
view show bonds
expect-bonds 52
view hide bonds
view style space-filling
expect-bonds 0
view style ball-and-stick
view show labels
view labels atom index
view projection perspective
settings preset Matte
settings atom-size 0.6
settings tab atoms
reset-view
screenshot rust/target/ui/view_sio2.png
settings close
settings scheme Greyscale
expect-colour 0 0.32 0.32 0.32
settings scheme AtomForge
open docs/manual/examples/cu_polycrystal.cif
expect-tabs 2
view hide labels
view colour grain-boundaries
expect-colour 0 0.2 0.72 0.98
expect-coloured 1 0.45 0.12 278
view colour crystal-orientation
view colour element
expect-colour 0 0.78 0.5 0.2
step replicate
set counts 2 1 1
view colour grain-boundaries
apply
undo
redo
expect-coloured 1 0.45 0.12 682
settings tab colors
reset-view
screenshot rust/target/ui/view_polycrystal.png
quit
